{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53368","headline":"诗偈 二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居士元无病，方丈现有疾。\n唯忧二乘者，缘事不得出。\n所以诃秽食，纯说波罗蜜。\n上方一盂饭，气满於七日。\n不假日月光，心王照斯室。\n文殊问不二，忘言功自毕。\n过去即如然，现在还同一。\n若能达此理，无求总成佛。\n（见前书卷二五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}